1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,085
The speed changes steadily from layer to layer.

2
00:00:03,085 --> 00:00:09,752
The rate of change of velocity with distance, d v by d x, is the velocity gradient.

3
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:21,223
Newton found that the viscous force between layers is proportional to the contact area and to the velocity gradient: F equals minus eta A d v by d x.

